ll they be recompensed except for what they used to do?","j":22,"h":44,"s":34,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"34:34","t":"And We did not send into a city any warner except that its affluent said, \"Indeed we, in that with which you were sent, are disbelievers.\"","j":22,"h":44,"s":34,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"34:35","t":"And they said, \"We are more [than the believers] in wealth and children, and we are not to be punished.\"","j":22,"h":44,"s":34,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"34:36","t":"Say, \"Indeed, my Lord extends provision for whom He wills and restricts [it], but most of the people do not know.\"","j":22,"h":44,"s":34,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"34:37","t":"And it is not your wealth or your children that bring you nearer to Us in position, but it is [by being] one who has believed and done righteousness. For them there will be the double reward for what they did, and they will be in the upper chambers [of Paradise], safe [and secure].","j":22,"h":44,"s":34,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"34:38","t":"And the ones who strive against Our verses to cause [them] failure - those will be brought into the punishment [to remain].","j":22,"h":44,"s":34,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"34:39","t":"Say, \"Indeed, my Lord extends provision for whom He wills of His servants and restricts [it] for him. But whatever thing you spend [in His cause] - He will compensate it; and He is the best of providers.\"","j":22,"h":44,"s":34,"a":39,"sd":null}],"juz":22,"hizb":44,"surahs":[34],"sajdah":false}